<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080808">
    <meta name="description" content="comatique — programming, cybersecurity and computer science.">

    <title>comatique</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark;
            --bg: #080808;
            --text: #ededed;
            --muted: #858585;
            --line: #252525;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
                         "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        button {
            font: inherit;
        }

        #life {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 0;
            opacity: 0.09;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .page {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            width: min(100% - 40px, 560px);
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 85px 0 35px;
        }

        .topbar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 70px;
        }

        .wordmark {
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .languages {
            display: flex;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .languages button {
            padding: 4px 7px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .languages button:hover,
        .languages button.active {
            border-color: var(--line);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .avatar {
            display: block;
            width: 68px;
            height: 68px;
            margin-bottom: 23px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 35px;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.3;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .status {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 19px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #bdbdbd;
        }

        section {
            margin-top: 42px;
        }

        .label {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: #b4b4b4;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 7px;
        }

        .skill {
            padding: 3px 9px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            color: #bdbdbd;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .link {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .link:first-child {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .link:hover {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .arrow {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .music {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            padding: 15px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .track {
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .artist {
            display: block;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        .music button {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            padding: 7px 11px;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text);
            font-size: 11px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .music button:hover {
            background: #ededed;
            color: #080808;
        }

        .music-status {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 70px;
            padding-top: 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
            color: #666;
            font-size: 11px;
        }

        /* Invisible YouTube player */
        #youtube-player {
            position: fixed;
            left: -500px;
            top: 0;
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .page {
                padding-top: 50px;
            }

            .topbar {
                margin-bottom: 50px;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *,
            *::before,
            *::after {
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
                transition: none !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <canvas id="life" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

    <main class="page">
        <nav class="topbar">
            <a class="wordmark" href="#">comatique.</a>

            <div class="languages" aria-label="Language">
                <button class="active" data-lang="en">EN</button>
                <button data-lang="fr">FR</button>
                <button data-lang="es">ES</button>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <header>
            <img
                class="avatar"
                src="https://github.com/eras-hallow.png"
                alt="GitHub profile picture"
            >

            <h1>comatique</h1>

            <p class="subtitle" data-i18n="subtitle">
                Programming · Cybersecurity · Systems
            </p>

            <div class="status">
                <span class="dot"></span>
                <span data-i18n="status">Learning by building.</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section>
            <div class="label" data-i18n="aboutTitle">About</div>
            <div data-i18n="about">
                <p>I'm a 16-year-old self-taught programmer currently
                studying computer science in high school. I've been
                interested in computers since childhood, especially
