                These days, I'm exploring cybersecurity, reverse
                engineering, digital forensics, networking and
                operating systems.</p>

                <p>In the long run, I'd like to teach computer science
                in higher education.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="label" data-i18n="techTitle">Technologies</div>

            <div class="skills">
                <span class="skill">Python</span>
                <span class="skill">C</span>
                <span class="skill">C++</span>
                <span class="skill">Lua / Luau</span>
                <span class="skill">HTML / CSS</span>
                <span class="skill">SQL</span>
                <span class="skill">x86-64 ASM</span>
                <span class="skill">Bash</span>
                <span class="skill">PowerShell</span>
                <span class="skill">Linux</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="label" data-i18n="linksTitle">Elsewhere</div>

            <div class="links">
                <a class="link" href="https://github.com/eras-hallow"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <span>GitHub</span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
                </a>

                <a class="link"
                   href="https://discord.com/users/1315098356724404319"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <span>Discord</span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
                </a>

                <a class="link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@comatique"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <span>YouTube</span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
                </a>

                <a class="link"
                   href="https://www.root-me.org/ctq?lang=fr#e0afd7dc3239691fa6480cb71b344c5a"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    <span>Root-Me</span><span class="arrow">↗</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="label" data-i18n="musicTitle">Now playing</div>

            <div class="music">
                <div>
                    <span class="track">Xtal</span>
                    <span class="artist">
                        Aphex Twin · Selected Ambient Works 85–92
                    </span>
                </div>

                <button id="music-button" data-i18n="playButton">
                    Play
                </button>
            </div>

            <p class="music-status" id="music-status" aria-live="polite"
               data-i18n="musicStatus">
                Sound may require a click to start.
            </p>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <span>© 2026 comatique</span>
            <span data-i18n="footer">Made out of curiosity.</span>
        </footer>
    </main>

    <div id="youtube-player" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <script>
        // Translations

        const translations = {
            en: {
                subtitle: "Programming · Cybersecurity · Systems",
                status: "Learning by building.",
                aboutTitle: "About",
                about: `
                    <p>I'm a 16-year-old self-taught programmer currently
                    studying computer science in high school. I've been
                    interested in computers since childhood, especially
                    in understanding how things work beneath the surface.</p>
                    <p>I've worked on Roblox projects involving scripting,
                    interfaces, building and collaborative development.
                    These days, I'm exploring cybersecurity, reverse
                    engineering, digital forensics, networking and
                    operating systems.</p>
                    <p>In the long run, I'd like to teach computer science
                    in higher education.</p>
                `,
                techTitle: "Technologies",
                linksTitle: "Elsewhere",
                musicTitle: "Now playing",
                playButton: "Play",
                pauseButton: "Pause",
                musicStatus: "Sound may require a click to start.",
                loadingStatus: "Loading the music player…",
                blockedStatus: "Autoplay blocked. Click Play to listen.",
                playingStatus: "Playing · Xtal",
                pausedStatus: "Playback paused.",
                errorStatus: "Unable to play the track. Try opening YouTube.",
                footer: "Made out of curiosity."
            },

            fr: {
                subtitle: "Programmation · Cybersécurité · Systèmes",
                status: "Apprendre en construisant.",
                aboutTitle: "À propos",
                about: `
                    <p>J'ai 16 ans et je suis développeur autodidacte,
                    actuellement au lycée en spécialité informatique.
                    Depuis l'enfance, j'aime comprendre comment les
                    technologies fonctionnent en profondeur.</p>
                    <p>J'ai travaillé sur des projets Roblox : scripts,
                    interfaces, construction et développement en équipe.
                    Aujourd'hui, je m'intéresse à la cybersécurité, au
                    reverse engineering, à la criminalistique numérique,
                    aux réseaux et aux systèmes d'exploitation.</p>
                    <p>À long terme, j'aimerais enseigner l'informatique
                    dans le supérieur.</p>
                `,
                techTitle: "Technologies",
                linksTitle: "Me retrouver",
                musicTitle: "En écoute",
                playButton: "Écouter",
                pauseButton: "Pause",
                musicStatus: "Un clic peut être nécessaire pour lancer le son.",
                loadingStatus: "Chargement du lecteur…",
                blockedStatus: "Lecture automatique bloquée. Clique sur Écouter.",
                playingStatus: "Lecture en cours · Xtal",
                pausedStatus: "Lecture en pause.",
                errorStatus: "Impossible de lire le morceau. Essaie sur YouTube.",
                footer: "Fait par curiosité."
            },

            es: {
                subtitle: "Programación · Ciberseguridad · Sistemas",
                status: "Aprender creando.",
                aboutTitle: "Sobre mí",
                about: `
                    <p>Tengo 16 años y soy programador autodidacta.
                    Actualmente estudio informática en el instituto.
                    Desde pequeño me interesa comprender cómo funcionan
                    las tecnologías más allá de su superficie.</p>
                    <p>He trabajado en proyectos de Roblox con scripts,
                    interfaces, construcción y desarrollo en equipo.
                    Ahora me interesan la ciberseguridad, la ingeniería
                    inversa, la informática forense, las redes y los
                    sistemas operativos.</p>
                    <p>A largo plazo, me gustaría enseñar informática
                    en la educación superior.</p>
                `,
                techTitle: "Tecnologías",
                linksTitle: "Encuéntrame",
                musicTitle: "Sonando ahora",
                playButton: "Reproducir",
                pauseButton: "Pausar",
                musicStatus: "Puede ser necesario hacer clic para escuchar.",
                loadingStatus: "Cargando el reproductor…",
                blockedStatus: "Reproducción automática bloqueada. Pulsa Reproducir.",
                playingStatus: "Reproduciendo · Xtal",
                pausedStatus: "Reproducción pausada.",
                errorStatus: "No se pudo reproducir. Prueba a abrir YouTube.",
                footer: "Hecho por curiosidad."
            }
        };

        let currentLang = "en";

        function setLanguage(lang) {
            currentLang = lang;
            const words = translations[lang];

            document.documentElement.lang = lang;

            document.querySelectorAll("[data-i18n]").forEach(element => {
                const key = element.dataset.i18n;

                if (words[key] !== undefined) {
                    element.innerHTML = words[key];
                }
            });

            document.querySelectorAll("[data-lang]").forEach(button => {
                const selected = button.dataset.lang === lang;

                button.classList.toggle("active", selected);
                button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", selected);
            });

            updateMusicButton();
        }

        document.querySelectorAll("[data-lang]").forEach(button => {
            button.addEventListener("click", () => {
                setLanguage(button.dataset.lang);
            });
        });

        // Conway's Game of Life

        const canvas = document.getElementById("life");
        const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d");

        const cellSize = 12;
        let grid = [];
        let columns = 0;
        let rows = 0;
        let lastFrame = 0;

        function resizeGrid() {
            canvas.width = window.innerWidth;
            canvas.height = window.innerHeight;

            columns = Math.ceil(canvas.width / cellSize);
            rows = Math.ceil(canvas.height / cellSize);

            grid = Array.from({ length: rows }, () =>
                Array.from({ length: columns }, () =>
                    Math.random() < 0.16 ? 1 : 0
                )
            );
        }

        function drawGrid() {
            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);
            ctx.fillStyle = "#ffffff";

            for (let y = 0; y < rows; y++) {
                for (let x = 0; x < columns; x++) {
                    if (grid[y][x]) {
                        ctx.fillRect(
                            x * cellSize + 2,
                            y * cellSize + 2,
                            cellSize - 3,
                            cellSize - 3
                        );
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        function evolveGrid() {
            const nextGrid = Array.from({ length: rows }, () =>
                Array(columns).fill(0)
            );

            for (let y = 0; y < rows; y++) {
                for (let x = 0; x < columns; x++) {
                    let neighbours = 0;

                    for (let dy = -1; dy <= 1; dy++) {
                        for (let dx = -1; dx <= 1; dx++) {
                            if (dx === 0 && dy === 0) continue;

                            const nx = x + dx;
                            const ny = y + dy;

                            if (nx >= 0 && nx < columns &&
                                ny >= 0 && ny < rows) {
                                neighbours += grid[ny][nx];
                            }
                        }
                    }

                    nextGrid[y][x] = grid[y][x]
                        ? (neighbours === 2 || neighbours === 3 ? 1 : 0)
                        : (neighbours === 3 ? 1 : 0);
                }
            }

            grid = nextGrid;
        }

        function animate(timestamp) {
            requestAnimationFrame(animate);

            if (timestamp - lastFrame < 130) return;

            lastFrame = timestamp;
            evolveGrid();
            drawGrid();
        }

        resizeGrid();
        requestAnimationFrame(animate);
        window.addEventListener("resize", resizeGrid);

        // YouTube player

        const musicButton = document.getElementById("music-button");
        const musicStatus = document.getElementById("music-status");

        let player = null;
        let playerReady = false;
        let isPlaying = false;

        function updateMusicButton() {
            const words = translations[currentLang];

            musicButton.textContent = isPlaying
                ? words.pauseButton
                : words.playButton;
        }

        musicButton.addEventListener("click", () => {
            if (!playerReady || !player) {
                musicStatus.textContent =
                    translations[currentLang].loadingStatus;
                return;
            }

            if (isPlaying) {
                player.pauseVideo();
            } else {
                player.playVideo();
            }
        });

        const youtubeScript = document.createElement("script");
        youtubeScript.src = "https://www.youtube.com/iframe_api";
        document.head.appendChild(youtubeScript);

        window.onYouTubeIframeAPIReady = function () {
            player = new YT.Player("youtube-player", {
                width: "200",
                height: "200",
                videoId: "sWcLccMuCA8",

                playerVars: {
                    autoplay: 1,
                    controls: 0,
                    playsinline: 1,
                    rel: 0
                },

                events: {
                    onReady: function (event) {
                        playerReady = true;

                        // Attempt autoplay; the browser may block sound.
                        event.target.playVideo();

                        musicStatus.textContent =
                            translations[currentLang].blockedStatus;
                    },

                    onStateChange: function (event) {
                        if (event.data === YT.PlayerState.PLAYING) {
                            isPlaying = true;
                            musicStatus.textContent =
                                translations[currentLang].playingStatus;
                        } else if (
                            event.data === YT.PlayerState.PAUSED ||
                            event.data === YT.PlayerState.ENDED
                        ) {
                            isPlaying = false;
                            musicStatus.textContent =
                                translations[currentLang].pausedStatus;
                        }

                        updateMusicButton();
                    },

                    onAutoplayBlocked: function () {
                        isPlaying = false;
                        musicStatus.textContent =
                            translations[currentLang].blockedStatus;
                        updateMusicButton();
                    },

                    onError: function () {
                        isPlaying = false;
                        musicStatus.textContent =
                            translations[currentLang].errorStatus;
                        updateMusicButton();
                    }
                }
            });
        };

        setLanguage("en");
    </script>
</body>
</html>
